{"id":96,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":"ٱقْرَأْ بِٱسْمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ","transliteration":"Iq'ra bi-is'mi rabbika alladhī khalaq","translation":"Recite in the name of your Lord who created -"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"خَلَقَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ مِنْ عَلَقٍ","transliteration":"Khalaqa l-insāna min ʿalaq","translation":"Created man from a clinging substance."},{"number":3,"arabicText":"ٱقْرَأْ وَرَبُّكَ ٱلْأَكْرَمُ","transliteration":"Iq'ra warabbuka l-akram","translation":"Recite, and your Lord is the most Generous -"},{"number":4,"arabicText":"ٱلَّذِى عَلَّمَ بِٱلْقَلَمِ","transliteration":"Alladhī ʿallama bil-qalam","translation":"Who taught by the pen -"},{"number":5,"arabicText":"عَلَّمَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ مَا لَمْ يَعْلَمْ","transliteration":"ʿallama l-insāna mā lam yaʿlam","translation":"Taught man that which he knew not."},{"number":6,"arabicText":"كَلَّآ إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ لَيَطْغَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Kallā inna l-insāna layaṭghā","translation":"No! [But] indeed, man transgresses"},{"number":7,"arabicText":"أَن رَّءَاهُ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Ar-raāhu is'taghnā","translation":"Because he sees himself self-sufficient."},{"number":8,"arabicText":"إِنَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ ٱلرُّجْعَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Inna ilā rabbika r-ruj'ʿā","translation":"Indeed, to your Lord is the return."},{"number":9,"arabicText":"أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يَنْهَىٰ","transliteration":"Ara-ayta alladhī yanhā","translation":"Have you seen the one who forbids"},{"number":10,"arabicText":"عَبْدًا إِذَا صَلَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿabdan idhā ṣallā","translation":"A servant when he prays?"},{"number":11,"arabicText":"أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَانَ عَلَى ٱلْهُدَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Ara-ayta in kāna ʿalā l-hudā","translation":"Have you seen if he is upon guidance"},{"number":12,"arabicText":"أَوْ أَمَرَ بِٱلتَّقْوَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Aw amara bil-taqwā","translation":"Or enjoins righteousness?"},{"number":13,"arabicText":"أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"Ara-ayta in kadhaba watawallā","translation":"Have you seen if he denies and turns away -"},{"number":14,"arabicText":"أَلَمْ يَعْلَم بِأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَرَىٰ","transliteration":"Alam yaʿlam bi-anna l-laha yarā","translation":"Does he not know that Allah sees?"},{"number":15,"arabicText":"كَلَّا لَئِن لَّمْ يَنتَهِ لَنَسْفَعًۢا بِٱلنَّاصِيَةِ","transliteration":"Kallā la-il-lam yantahi lanasfaʿan bil-nāṣiyat","translation":"No! If he does not desist, We will surely drag him by the forelock -"},{"number":16,"arabicText":"نَاصِيَةٍۢ كَٰذِبَةٍ خَاطِئَةٍۢ","transliteration":"Nāṣiyatin kādhibatin khāṭi-at","translation":"A lying, sinning forelock."},{"number":17,"arabicText":"فَلْيَدْعُ نَادِيَهُۥ","transliteration":"Falyadʿu nādiyah","translation":"Then let him call his associates;"},{"number":18,"arabicText":"سَنَدْعُ ٱلزَّبَانِيَةَ","transliteration":"Sanadʿu z-zabāniyat","translation":"We will call the angels of Hell."},{"number":19,"arabicText":"كَلَّا لَا تُطِعْهُ وَٱسْجُدْ وَٱقْتَرِب ۩","transliteration":"Kallā lā tuṭiʿ'hu wa-us'jud wa-iq'tarib","translation":"No! Do not obey him. But prostrate and draw near [to Allah]."}]}